
# STOCKWISE
## Smart Stock Optimization System

STOCKWISE is a Python-based smart inventory management and stock
optimization project developed for a college Project-Based Learning (PBL)
submission.

It combines inventory management, demand forecasting, reorder
optimization and supplier performance analysis.

---

## 1. Project Objective

The main objective of STOCKWISE is to improve inventory decisions
by helping businesses understand product demand, avoid unnecessary
stock accumulation and make better purchasing decisions.

---

## 2. Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- SQLite
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- REST API
- Waitress

---

## 3. Main Features

### 1. Python Demand Forecasting

- Analyses recorded sales.
- Uses Weighted Moving Average.
- Applies a limited trend adjustment.
- Generates a seven-day demand forecast.
- Calculates a simple forecast error (MAE).

### 2. EOQ and Smart Replenishment

- Calculates Economic Order Quantity.
- Calculates safety stock.
- Calculates reorder point.
- Suggests an order quantity.

### 3. Supplier Performance Intelligence

- Records supplier deliveries.
- Calculates on-time delivery percentage.
- Calculates average delivery delay.
- Calculates average lead time.
- Generates a transparent prototype score.

