## 10. Important Mathematical Formulas

### Economic Order Quantity

EOQ = sqrt((2 x D x S) / H)

D = Annual demand
S = Ordering cost per order
H = Annual holding cost per unit

### Safety Stock

Safety Stock = Z x Standard Deviation x sqrt(Lead Time)

### Reorder Point

Reorder Point = (Daily Demand x Lead Time) + Safety Stock

### Supplier On-Time Percentage

On-Time Percentage =
(On-Time Deliveries / Total Deliveries) x 100

### Forecast Error

MAE = Average of absolute forecast errors.

