## 13. Limitations

- This is an academic prototype.
- It is primarily designed for local demonstration.
- It does not include user authentication.
- It is not currently a cloud-based multi-user system.
- Forecast accuracy depends on the quality and quantity of sales data.
- Demo sales are simulated records, not actual business transactions.

